  p_Description_51ed2201fb4d := 'JSON describing the records to score. Populate exactly one of: records (id/pk array), viewId, listId, filter ({entityName, extraFilter, maxRows}), single ({entityName, primaryKey}). A filter''s maxRows is a guard: a scope matching more rows is refused (READ_CAP_EXCEEDED), never sampled.';
