  p_Description_a0c1bfa2b83b := 'Returns the newest MJ: ML Training Runs row of one training pipeline whose Status is Running and that started after the given instant, or no row. Predictive Studio auto-train reads it under the pipeline lock to claim the pipeline for one training at a time (single-flight, D4-12): a run in flight means another training owns the pipeline.';
  p_SQL_a0c1bfa2b83b := '-- Predictive Studio auto-train: the training run of one pipeline that is in flight now, if any.
--
-- TrainingClaims.ClaimPipeline runs this through RunQuery inside its transaction, after it holds the
-- pipeline lock (Predictive Studio: Lock Pipeline For Publish), so every claim of one pipeline reads
