  p_Description_5ca2484da193 := 'Takes a shared lock on one MJ: ML Model Scoring Bindings row for the rest of the caller''s transaction and returns its Status. Predictive Studio''s scoring service runs it first in every writing batch and stops the run when the binding is Withdrawn; a withdrawal waits for the batches in flight.';
  p_SQL_5ca2484da193 := '-- Predictive Studio scoring: lock one scoring binding row for a scoring batch and read its current Status.
