  p_SQL_718578e9d077 := '-- Predictive Studio registry check, findings (b) and (h) (§5.7 R6, R7): the newest applied `publish` record of a
-- model (a publish or a rollback) whose model is no longer Published nor Archived by the gate: its status was changed
