  p_Description_a25641e0640d := 'Returns one row: the number of columns in the database and a checksum over every column''s object, name, ordinal and type, the number of applied migrations, and the newest MJ: Entities change. The Predictive Studio zero-schema-change checks (IT187, gate G5.6) read it before a model is published and bound and after it scores: a prediction reaches a record with no column, migration or CodeGen run, so all values stay the same.';
  p_SQL_a25641e0640d := '-- Predictive Studio: the schema''s column fingerprint, the applied-migration count and the newest entity-metadata change.
